sequenceDiagram
    participant Scan as ScanJobTaskActor
    participant Prepare as JobTaskPrepareActor
    participant Batch as JobTaskBatchDao
    participant WaitH as WaitJobPrepareHandler
    participant RunH as RunningJobPrepareHandler
    participant TermH as TerminalJobPrepareHandler
    participant Gen as JobTaskBatchGenerator
    participant Wheel as JobTimerWheel
    participant Timer as JobTimerTask
    participant Exec as JobExecutorActor
    participant Client as RequestClientActor/Client
    participant Callback as ClientCallbackHandler
    participant Result as JobExecutorResultActor
    participant BatchH as JobTaskBatchHandler

    Scan->>Prepare: tell(JobTaskPrepareDTO)

    Prepare->>Batch: 查询 jobId 下 NOT_COMPLETE 批次
    alt 存在未完成批次
        loop 遍历每个未完成批次
            alt status = WAITING
                Prepare->>WaitH: handle(prepare)
                WaitH->>Wheel: 确保任务挂入时间轮
            else status = RUNNING
                Prepare->>RunH: handle(prepare)
                RunH->>BatchH: 尝试批次收口 / 超时检查
                alt 不是 onlyTimeoutCheck
                    RunH->>Gen: 按阻塞策略决定是否生成新批次
                end
            end
        end
    else 没有未完成批次
        Prepare->>TermH: 用“模拟终态”走终态处理
        TermH->>Gen: generateJobTaskBatch()
        Gen->>Wheel: 注册 JobTimerTask
    end

    Wheel->>Timer: 到触发时间
    Timer->>Exec: tell(TaskExecuteDTO)

    Exec->>BatchH: 更新批次为 RUNNING/CANCEL
    Exec->>Exec: 生成 JobTask 实例
    Exec->>Client: 下发到客户端执行

    alt 客户端执行完成或失败回调
        Client->>Callback: 执行结果
        Callback->>Result: tell(JobExecutorResultDTO)
        Result->>Result: 更新 JobTask 明细状态/结果
        Result->>BatchH: handleResult(CompleteJobBatchDTO)
        BatchH->>BatchH: 汇总批次是否完成、是否需要 reduce、是否开后继流程
    else 下发客户端失败
        Client->>Result: 直接投递 FAIL 结果
        Result->>BatchH: 批次收口
    end